## Join a coach

Your coach sends you a link (or invites you by username). Open it, choose what they may see, and send
the request. Nothing is shared until they accept. Some coaches charge through their link: you pay on
the link's page before coaching starts.

<HowTo id="pro.coach" />

## Check-ins

When your coach gives you a check-in form, it shows as Due under Check-ins on the phone, or My coach on
the web. After they review it you'll see their reply with it.

<CanCant ids={["my-coach"]} />
